    "detailed_description": "<h1>Join our Discord to claim the beta test access!</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3530490/extras/4bffd1db07cd7f948985295b53ad8942.avif?t=1755351802\" width=630 height=216 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3530490/extras/5e1d483359075718460d092e06b387c8.avif?t=1755351802\" width=600 height=120 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Fadedlands: The Reckless Squad</i> is a challenging, fast-paced turn-based game with roguelike elements.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do you think turn-based means just standing still and attacking? Here, <strong>positioning is key</strong>! Predict enemy skills, move flexibly, and dodge deadly strikes!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3530490/extras/67743aa362a91370044dcc9d2e217634.poster.avif?t=1755351802\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3530490/extras/67743aa362a91370044dcc9d2e217634.webm?t=1755351802\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3530490/extras/67743aa362a91370044dcc9d2e217634.mp4?t=1755351802\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The timing and positioning of your skills determine victory or defeat! Knock back enemies and you might even make them hurt themselves\u2014<strong>experience an unprecedented thrill in turn-based combat!</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3530490/extras/4d2bdbf09980106f33f3b2ef811ed574.poster.avif?t=1755351802\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3530490/extras/4d2bdbf09980106f33f3b2ef811ed574.webm?t=1755351802\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3530490/extras/4d2bdbf09980106f33f3b2ef811ed574.mp4?t=1755351802\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With the addition of roguelike elements, you\u2019ll acquire Blessings from shops or random events. These Blessings not only boost your stats but also change the way your skills attack, allowing you to craft a unique combat style and make your squad stronger with every battle!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3530490/extras/8a5015561bbbc00002d476fb5a7e0ede.poster.avif?t=1755351802\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3530490/extras/8a5015561bbbc00002d476fb5a7e0ede.webm?t=1755351802\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3530490/extras/8a5015561bbbc00002d476fb5a7e0ede.mp4?t=1755351802\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3530490/extras/1f0dfbe6707c060d41356319e2d4e2ba.avif?t=1755351802\" width=600 height=120 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After your adventure, <strong>base building is where the real challenge begins!</strong> Use the resources you bring back to unlock new buildings and gameplay, creating your very own <strong>adventurer\u2019s paradise!</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can recruit more companions with unique abilities at the tavern, or improve your adventurers\u2019 skills at the training ground to prepare for the next adventure!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3530490/extras/a6f82f00e5b00a7a3476cd8374f2d935.poster.avif?t=1755351802\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3530490/extras/a6f82f00e5b00a7a3476cd8374f2d935.webm?t=1755351802\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3530490/extras/a6f82f00e5b00a7a3476cd8374f2d935.mp4?t=1755351802\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3530490/extras/457a440853873c2a88e26a6035ac3c65.avif?t=1755351802\" width=600 height=120 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don\u2019t fear death! <strong>Every failure is an opportunity to grow stronger!</strong> Collect resources to unlock new characters, cards, and buildings, making your squad more powerful with each defeat!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Clearing the game is just the beginning. Higher difficulties, stronger enemies, and more bizarre weather and terrain are waiting for you to conquer!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3530490/extras/3778630a07f655c5bd24d72a2df2871d.poster.avif?t=1755351802\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3530490/extras/3778630a07f655c5bd24d72a2df2871d.webm?t=1755351802\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3530490/extras/3778630a07f655c5bd24d72a2df2871d.mp4?t=1755351802\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If our game has caught your interest, don't forget to add it to your wishlist!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3530490/extras/5e1d483359075718460d092e06b387c8.avif?t=1755351802\" width=600 height=120 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Fadedlands: The Reckless Squad</i> is a challenging, fast-paced turn-based game with roguelike elements.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do you think turn-based means just standing still and attacking? Here, <strong>positioning is key</strong>! Predict enemy skills, move flexibly, and dodge deadly strikes!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3530490/extras/67743aa362a91370044dcc9d2e217634.poster.avif?t=1755351802\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3530490/extras/67743aa362a91370044dcc9d2e217634.webm?t=1755351802\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3530490/extras/67743aa362a91370044dcc9d2e217634.mp4?t=1755351802\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The timing and positioning of your skills determine victory or defeat! Knock back enemies and you might even make them hurt themselves\u2014<strong>experience an unprecedented thrill in turn-based combat!</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3530490/extras/4d2bdbf09980106f33f3b2ef811ed574.poster.avif?t=1755351802\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3530490/extras/4d2bdbf09980106f33f3b2ef811ed574.webm?t=175535