 class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3530490/extras/a6f82f00e5b00a7a3476cd8374f2d935.poster.avif?t=1755351802\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3530490/extras/a6f82f00e5b00a7a3476cd8374f2d935.webm?t=1755351802\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3530490/extras/a6f82f00e5b00a7a3476cd8374f2d935.mp4?t=1755351802\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3530490/extras/457a440853873c2a88e26a6035ac3c65.avif?t=1755351802\" width=600 height=120 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don\u2019t fear death! <strong>Every failure is an opportunity to grow stronger!</strong> Collect resources to unlock new characters, cards, and buildings, making your squad more powerful with each defeat!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Clearing the game is just the beginning. Higher difficulties, stronger enemies, and more bizarre weather and terrain are waiting for you to conquer!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3530490/extras/3778630a07f655c5bd24d72a2df2871d.poster.avif?t=1755351802\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3530490/extras/3778630a07f655c5bd24d72a2df2871d.webm?t=1755351802\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3530490/extras/3778630a07f655c5bd24d72a2df2871d.mp4?t=1755351802\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If our game has caught your interest, don't forget to add it to your wishlist!</p>",
